[I] Fontcache extension headers

[T] fontcacheproto contains the protocol headers for the X11 Fontcache
[T] extension, which allowed clients to control the font cache of XFree86 X
[T] servers. It is obsolete and only kept for compatibility.

[U] https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/proto/fontcacheproto

